🌡️ Temperature Converter

A beginner-friendly Python program that converts temperatures between Celsius (°C) and Fahrenheit (°F).

The program allows the user to perform multiple conversions, rounds the results to 2 decimal places, and handles invalid unit input with a friendly message.

📌 Features
🌡️ Converts Celsius to Fahrenheit
🌡️ Converts Fahrenheit to Celsius
🔢 Accepts decimal temperature values
🎯 Rounds results to 2 decimal places
🔄 Allows multiple temperature conversions
🚪 Allows the user to quit by entering q
⚠️ Handles invalid unit input
🔤 Accepts both uppercase and lowercase C / F
